window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-048-00beadf931090b82.json"]={sha256:"00beadf931090b822457ac0edcad000a24aecaff46f69813ccdc5439ad214fb6",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-9e8cba3a789ff3a4","url":"https://atom-computing.com/quantum-computing-technology/","title":"Quantum Computing Technology","titleEn":"Quantum Computing Technology","publisher":"Atom Computing","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-048","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-048","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-049","referenceUrls":["https://queracomputing.github.io/bloqade/latest/analog/home/background/"],"title":"QuEra Rydberg 排程：阻塞衝突與並行層","titleEn":"QuEra Rydberg scheduling: blockade conflicts and parallel layers","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付相位分布、兩正交分量與小噪聲近似誤差表。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver phase distributions, coherence quadratures and small-noise approximation errors. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『QuEra Rydberg 排程：阻塞衝突與並行層』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付任務衝突圖、著色證明、甘特圖與新增邊回歸測試。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'QuEra Rydberg scheduling: blockade conflicts and parallel layers', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver a conflict graph, coloring proof, Gantt chart and added-edge regression case.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：若相位誤差零均值Gaussian、RMS為σφ，平均相干對比C=exp(−σφ²/2)；固定相位偏差需另外校正。 使用教學σφ=0.2 rad；相位是弧度，不能直接代入角度值。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-0.2**2/2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以小σ近似1−σ²/2交叉檢查，列出精確與近似殘差，不將近似外推σ=3。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：教學將8個任務排成衝突路徑圖；相鄰不能同時，二著色需2層。總時間=層數×每層時長，忽略跨層切換。 使用每層教學時長2 μs；序列執行8層作基準，任務編號1至8。 以手算或試算表計算名義式8*2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：列7條路徑邊，每條兩端顏色須不同；若新增1–3衝突，原奇偶方案失效，須重新著色。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For zero-mean Gaussian phase error with RMS σφ, averaged coherence contrast C=exp(−σφ²/2); fixed phase bias needs separate correction. Use Teaching σφ=0.2 rad; phase is in radians, not numerical degrees. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-0.2**2/2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Cross-check with1−σ²/2 for small σ, record residuals and do not extrapolate to σ=3.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Model8 tasks as a conflict path graph; adjacent tasks cannot coincide, so two coloring gives2 layers. Time equals layers times layer duration, excluding switching. Use Teaching layer duration2 μs; sequential8-layer execution is the baseline for tasks1–8. Evaluate nominal expression 8*2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: List all7 path edges and require different colors at both ends; adding conflict1–3 invalidates the odd/even schedule.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-058","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-36493-1"],"title":"光子資源態工廠：多路複用的可用率","titleEn":"Photonic resource-state factories: multiplexed availability","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付相位分布、兩正交分量與小噪聲近似誤差表。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver phase distributions, coherence quadratures and small-noise approximation errors. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"計算多個獨立嘗試中至少一次成功的機率，避免把期望數當可用率。","differenceEn":"Calculate at-least-one success among independent attempts without confusing expected count with availability.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：若相位誤差零均值Gaussian、RMS為σφ，平均相干對比C=exp(−σφ²/2)；固定相位偏差需另外校正。 使用教學σφ=0.2 rad；相位是弧度，不能直接代入角度值。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-0.2**2/2)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以小σ近似1−σ²/2交叉檢查，列出精確與近似殘差，不將近似外推σ=3。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。每次成功率0.2，並行來源N=4；僅選一個成功來源輸出。 P可用=1−0.8⁴。 代入 1-0.8**4，得到 0.5904 dimensionless。N個獨立相同成功率p的嘗試，其可用率1−(1−p)^N；不含選路損耗。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For zero-mean Gaussian phase error with RMS σφ, averaged coherence contrast C=exp(−σφ²/2); fixed phase bias needs separate correction. Use Teaching σφ=0.2 rad; phase is in radians, not numerical degrees. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-0.2**2/2) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Cross-check with1−σ²/2 for small σ, record residuals and do not extrapolate to σ=3.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Per-attempt success0.2 withN=4 parallel sources; select only one successful source. Pavailable=1−0.8^4. Substituting 1-0.8**4 gives 0.5904 dimensionless. N independent attempts with successp give availability1−(1−p)^N, before switching loss. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-96ecec88f91a75bd","url":"https://queracomputing.github.io/bloqade/latest/analog/home/background/","title":"Background: Neutral Atom Qubits","titleEn":"Background: Neutral Atom Qubits","publisher":"QuEra Bloqade","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-30f368cdd1d99110","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-36493-1","title":"Fusion-based quantum computation","titleEn":"Fusion-based quantum computation","publisher":"Bartolucci et al. / Nature Communications","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
